/avatar.png?height=80" title="Norbert de Langen" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jFejKr fGEJMP sc-ff045f41-0 fEQhME"></div></a></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 giVqMW eDZLcq"><a href="/storybook/updates/storybook-won-an-open-source-award-at-react-amsterdam-conference"><p color="black.900" font-weight="600" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 hAeQmn">Storybook won an open source award at React Amsterdam Conference</p></a><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 dgVncz"><div><div style="display:inline" font-size="14px" class="sc-63bf996f-0 bKpumw sc-63bf996f-2 lmrrds">undefined</div></div> <a class="sc-7169fd69-0 emApzL" font-size="12px" color="primary.500" href="/storybook/updates/storybook-won-an-open-source-award-at-react-amsterdam-conference">Read more</a></div><div color="black.600" font-size="12px" class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 ccmCzU">Published on April 14, 2018 by <a title="Norbert de Langen" class="hover:underline" href="/ndelangen">Norbert de Langen</a></div></div></div></div></div><a href="/storybook/updates"><button data-cy="view-all-updates-btn" width="1" font-size="14px" class="sc-532480db-0 fvwWQl">View all updates<!-- --> →</button></a></div></div></section><div id="category-ABOUT" class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-b1a93422-0 EBMGw bxETTS"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 fqoDra ferUGe"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 sc-b1a93422-2 htvGag faHCM kKqmej"><img src="/static/images/collective-navigation/CollectiveNavbarIconAbout.png" alt="" class="sc-b1a93422-1 dWuXCV"/></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 kelEPL fHSAwH"><h2 data-cy="category-ABOUT-title" font-size="32px" font-weight="normal" color="black.900" class="sc-1709896-0 bWUsCp">About</h2></div><hr class="sc-d0d050d8-0 hGzNES"/></div></div><section id="section-about" data-cy="section-about" class="sc-3340244f-0 iTPjmR"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-7355880b-0 cIqaQH"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 eRmECd"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 jRaTqn"><div><div data-cy="longDescription" font-size="14px" class="sc-63bf996f-0 bKpumw sc-63bf996f-2 lmrrds"><p>Storybook is a development environment for UI components. It allows you to browse a component library, view the different states of each component, and interactively develop and test components.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="section-our-team" data-cy="section-our-team" class="sc-3340244f-0 eGKBUl"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-7355880b-0 jyulmr"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 uzGKt"><h2 font-weight="500" color="black.700" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 sc-dcb94ee2-5 kmgLsS">Our team</h2><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 bGxwtX"><div width="144" height="auto" class="sc-2c35d607-0 sc-d82cae7-0 bfQJEs gMcYKv"><div class="sc-d82cae7-1 jfGyLV"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 inLDtj"><a href="/ndelangen"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/ndelangen/6f7b5a6/avatar.png);background-size:cover" size="64" type="USER" src="https://images.opencollective.com/ndelangen/6f7b5a6/avatar.png" title="Norbert de Langen" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 kFsjOb cskNqH sc-ff045f41-0 iEGXco"></div></a></div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 iJlvnw hqNDzM"><a href="/ndelangen"><p color="black.900" font-weight="500" title="Norbert de Langen" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 boFGUd">Norbert de La...</p></a><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 gmTaiH"><div class="sc-afa001f2-0 fZtaHx sc-d82cae7-4 kJsbDm">Admin</div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 eVvpCT"></div></div></div><div width="144" height="auto" class="sc-2c35d607-0 sc-d82cae7-0 bfQJEs gMcYKv"><div class="sc-d82cae7-1 jfGyLV"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 inLDtj"><a href="/shilman"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/shilman/ffea2db/avatar.png);background-size:cover" size="64" type="USER" src="https://images.opencollective.com/shilman/ffea2db/avatar.png" title="Michael Shilman" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 kFsjOb cskNqH sc-ff045f41-0 iEGXco"></div></a></div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 iJlvnw hqNDzM"><a href="/shilman"><p color="black.900" font-weight="500" tit